Yes, you've manually altered the ebuild and this is something portage=20
doesn't like (for security reasons). The easy solution was to regenerate=20
the manifest:

# ebuild <path-to-squid-ebuild> digest

BTW, back on topic, bug #160637[1] for those who are interested is the=20
workspace for the epoll squid bug.

[1] https://bugs.gentoo.org/show_bug.cgi?id=3D160637

